-q
----------------------------------------------------------------------
10 CLS
' READ auto-coerces between Integer and Single: an Integer DATA element
' read into a Single variable goes through ITOF, and a Single DATA element
' read into an Integer variable goes through FTOI. Every line prints the
' expected value, the value actually read, and -1 if they match.
' Integer DATA -> Single variable (ITOF)
20 DATA 5
25 READ A
30 E% = ABS(A - 5.0) < 0.00001
35 PRINT "5"; A; E%
40 DATA -7
45 READ B
50 E% = ABS(B + 7.0) < 0.00001
55 PRINT "-7"; B; E%
' Single DATA (exact integer value) -> Integer variable (FTOI)
60 DATA 9.0
65 READ C%
70 E% = (C% = 9)
75 PRINT "9"; C%; E%
80 DATA -12.0
85 READ D%
90 E% = (D% = -12)
95 PRINT "-12"; D%; E%
' Single DATA (fractional) -> Integer variable: FTOI truncates toward zero
100 DATA 7.9
105 READ E1%
110 F% = (E1% = 7)
115 PRINT "7"; E1%; F%
120 DATA -7.9
125 READ G%
130 H% = (G% = -7)
135 PRINT "-7"; G%; H%
' A mixed-type DATA line, read alternating Integer/Single targets
140 DATA 1,2.5,3,4.5
145 READ I%,J,K%,L
150 E% = (I% = 1) AND (ABS(J - 2.5) < 0.00001) AND (K% = 3) AND (ABS(L - 4.5) < 0.00001)
155 PRINT "1 2.5 3 4.5"; I%; J; K%; L; E%
' RESTORE back to a coercing line and re-read to confirm the pointer and
' DATATY/DATACN state reset correctly after crossing a type boundary
160 RESTORE 60
165 READ M%
170 E% = (M% = 9)
175 PRINT "9"; M%; E%
